00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A second number can appear on a screen and still be missed.
Scientists call this an attentional blink.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
That experiment is about the limits of attention—
not proof that any audio program can erase them.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Zen12 is sold as twelve-minute meditation audio,
across twelve levels and four listening styles.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The seller promises much more. We haven't found independent
proof that this specific bundle does an hour of meditation in twelve minutes.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free twelve-minute routine first.
Read the evidence. Decide whether the format, not a miracle, suits you.
